    "If i is greater than k, the new item is discarded.",
    "After processing n items, every item has an equal probability of k/n of being in the reservoir.",
    "You can stop processing at any point and still have a uniformly sampled set of k items.",
    "The replacement rule involves keeping the first k items and then letting each new item randomly replace an existing item with the appropriate probability."
