    "Social-engineering-style persuasion constructs a prompt or sequence of prompts that manipulates the model into dropping its safeguards.",
    "In short, prompt hacking disguises the intent, changes the requested format, or persuades the model to adopt a role that supposedly ignores its rules."
] 

